(585, 1, 'page', '{\"name\":\"Technology Consultants\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"https:\\/\\/workshopit.info\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<shortcode>[hero-banner style=\\\"style-2\\\" title=\\\"Welcome to Workshop IT.\\\" description=\\\"Workshop IT- where innovation meets expertise. We offer top-tier business and technology courses, one-on-one consultations, and valuable resources to help you succeed in the digital world. Whether you\'re an entrepreneur, tech enthusiast, or professional looking to upskill, our platform provides expert guidance, hands-on training, and strategic insights to elevate your career and business. \\ud83d\\ude80 Learn. Grow. Succeed. Join us today!\\\" image=\\\"software-it-services-transparent-png.png\\\" image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/consulting-banner-img02.png\\\" image_2=\\\"general\\/consulting-banner-img03.png\\\" background_image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/consulting-banner-shape01.png\\\" background_image_2=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-shape01.png\\\"][\\/hero-banner]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[company-overview style=\\\"style-6\\\" title=\\\"Changing The Way To Do Best IT &amp; Business Solutions\\\" subtitle=\\\"WHAT WE ARE DOING\\\" description=\\\"In a world driven by innovation and technology, businesses are continually seeking new ways to stay ahead of the competition. Workshop IT - Technology and Business Consultants is at the forefront of this evolution, reshaping how IT and business solutions are conceived, delivered, and implemented. Their approach is centered on transforming traditional methods into dynamic, future-ready strategies that enable organizations to thrive in a digital-first era.\\\" image=\\\"4.PNG\\\" background_image=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-bg.jpg\\\" background_image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-img-shape01.png\\\" background_image_2=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-shape02.png\\\" quantity=\\\"2\\\" title_1=\\\"Growing Business\\\" description_1=\\\"Finance Helps You To Convert Into A Strategic A