(628, 1, 'page', '{\"name\":\"Technology Consultants\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"https:\\/\\/workshopit.info\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<shortcode>[hero-banner style=\\\"style-2\\\" title=\\\"Welcome to Workshop IT.\\\" description=\\\"Courses | Consultations | Resources | Total IT Solutions Workshop IT is your all-in-one platform to learn, develop, and grow in the digital world. We offer industry-relevant Business, Startup, IT courses, expert consultations,AI Transformation and practical resources to help individuals and businesses succeed. Whether you\'re a beginner or a professional, our services are designed to meet your needs. From skill-building to solving technical challenges, to providing Total IT solutions, we guide you every step of the way. Empower your future with the right knowledge and support. Create a creative future with Workshop IT.\\\" image=\\\"software-it-services-transparent-png.png\\\" image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/consulting-banner-img02.png\\\" image_2=\\\"general\\/consulting-banner-img03.png\\\" background_image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/consulting-banner-shape01.png\\\" background_image_2=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-shape01.png\\\"][\\/hero-banner]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[company-overview style=\\\"style-6\\\" title=\\\"Changing The Way To Do Best IT &amp; Business Solutions\\\" subtitle=\\\"WHAT WE ARE DOING\\\" description=\\\"In a world driven by innovation and technology, businesses are continually seeking new ways to stay ahead of the competition. Workshop IT - Technology and Business Consultants is at the forefront of this evolution, reshaping how IT and business solutions are conceived, delivered, and implemented. Their approach is centered on transforming traditional methods into dynamic, future-ready strategies that enable organizations to thrive in a digital-first era.\\\" image=\\\"4.PNG\\\" background_image=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-bg.jpg\\\" background_image_1=\\\"backgrounds\\/about-img-shape01.pn