(7, '<p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Dear Alex Amin,</p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">I appreciate your reaching out with this investment opportunity. I am always open to exploring strategic collaborations, especially those that align with my business vision and growth plans.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">I would be interested in learning more details regarding the investment, including the nature of the funds, potential areas of collaboration, and expected terms of engagement. Transparency and risk assessment are key factors for me when considering new ventures, so I would appreciate any relevant information you can share.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Please let me know a convenient time for a confidential discussion. Looking forward to your response.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Best regards,<br>Delowar Hossen</p><p style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;word-spacing:0px;\">Founder at Workshop IT.</p>', 8, '2025-03-01 11:16:35', '2025-03-01 11:16:35'),
